# Pairs with GateOwnership. The reparent write must not overlap a split of the same leaf.
MODULE: SetParentIgnoresBusyGate
TARGET: GateOwnership
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: SetParentAsync persists without waiting for the leaf's split gate
PERTURBS: SetParentTakeGate

--- FIND
    /\ seed[l] = "admitted"
    /\ gate[l] = "free"
--- REPLACE
    /\ seed[l] = "admitted"
    \* MUTATION: the gate is not awaited
--- END
